     3	// Provider credential setup for the Agent dock.
     4	//
     5	// Verifying a key and building the service that will use it are the same act
     6	// here: the check runs one real request through the provider adapter the
     7	// Agent goes on to use, so a key that passes is a key the Agent is already
     8	// talking through, and the round-trip the user is shown is the one that
     9	// actually happened. Nothing separate has to be kept in sync with it.
