    11	// GUI-free and poll-driven, mirroring IAgentService: transport callbacks only
    12	// queue work, and the owner releases outcomes from poll() on the GUI thread.
    13	// Persistence is injected, so this file never reaches AppConfig and stays
    14	// linkable into the GUI-free contract tests.
